@startuml assets
!include theme.iuml
title Crafty — image capture, immutable assets, and annotation lineage
top to bottom direction

state "Browser capture session" as Capture {
  [*] --> Camera
  state "Camera open" as Camera
  state "Local shot collection" as Shots
  state "Edit selected shot\nfreehand / text / crop" as Edit
  Camera --> Shots : button or hotkey
  Shots --> Camera : rotate object; take another shot
  Shots --> Shots : delete an unsent shot
  Shots --> Edit : annotate
  Edit --> Shots : retain original + edited copy
}

state "Uploading / staging" as Staging
state "Ready asset\nimmutable bytes + metadata" as Ready
state "Referenced ready asset\nmessage / interaction / revision" as Attached
state "Derived annotation / snapshot\nnew asset identity" as Derived
state "Rejected / abandoned upload" as Rejected
state "Unreferenced upload cleanup" as Cleanup

Shots --> Staging : submit retained images
Staging --> Ready : verify size, format, hash; finalize blob
Staging --> Rejected : invalid upload / abandoned transfer
Rejected --> Cleanup : staging TTL
Ready --> Attached : message transaction references asset IDs
Ready --> Cleanup : unattached and expired
Attached --> Derived : annotate photo / draft\nor snapshot a ready model
Derived --> Staging : upload flattened image\n+ optional editable annotation data
Attached --> Attached : view / download / agent retrieval

note right of Ready
  assetId, projectId, kind, MIME, bytes, SHA-256
  dimensions, normalized orientation, createdAt
  derivedFromAssetId, sourceRevisionId, runId where applicable
  Storage key and temporary URL are not the asset identity.
end note
note right of Derived
  Browser model snapshot records revision + GLB hash + camera pose.
  FreeCAD renders reference their run and native geometry snapshot.
  Annotation coordinates refer to normalized source pixels.
  Flattened PNG is directly visible to the agent.
  Keep the source unchanged; edits create another asset.
end note
note bottom of Attached
  Message/interaction submission waits for all referenced assets to be ready.
  A failed submission can reuse ready uploads with the same idempotency key.
  Browser blob URLs and local file paths never become durable references.
  Clearing the capture tray does not delete published conversation assets.
  Attachment is a reference relationship; the asset itself remains ready.
end note
@enduml
